1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:00,634
They wanted to

2
00:00:00,634 --> 00:00:01,826
cancel their internet.

3
00:00:01,826 --> 00:00:03,844
The employee wouldn't stop asking why.

4
00:00:03,844 --> 00:00:05,504
July 2014.

5
00:00:05,504 --> 00:00:06,561
Veronica Belmont calls

6
00:00:06,561 --> 00:00:08,388
Comcast to disconnect.

7
00:00:08,388 --> 00:00:09,282
She explains.

8
00:00:09,282 --> 00:00:10,884
He asks again.

9
00:00:10,884 --> 00:00:11,975
Ten minutes in,

10
00:00:11,975 --> 00:00:12,788
she hands the phone

11
00:00:12,788 --> 00:00:14,387
to her husband, Ryan Block.

12
00:00:14,387 --> 00:00:15,335
Ryan hits record.

13
00:00:15,335 --> 00:00:16,287
"Why is it that you're not

14
00:00:16,287 --> 00:00:16,809
wanting to have

15
00:00:16,809 --> 00:00:19,165
the number one rated internet service?"

16
00:00:19,165 --> 00:00:21,266
Ryan: "This phone call is

17
00:00:21,266 --> 00:00:22,752
a really, actually, amazing

18
00:00:22,752 --> 00:00:24,517
representative example of why

19
00:00:24,517 --> 00:00:26,491
I don't want to stay with Comcast."

20
00:00:26,491 --> 00:00:28,012
Eighteen minutes in all.

21
00:00:28,012 --> 00:00:31,441
Finally... disconnected.

22
00:00:31,441 --> 00:00:32,428
Veronica still went to a

23
00:00:32,428 --> 00:00:34,080
Comcast store to double-check.

24
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,218
Ryan posted the recording.

25
00:00:35,218 --> 00:00:36,264
It went viral.

26
00:00:36,264 --> 00:00:38,319
Comcast apologized.

27
00:00:38,319 --> 00:00:39,701
How the employee spoke was

28
00:00:39,701 --> 00:00:41,702
"not consistent with how we train."

29
00:00:41,702 --> 00:00:43,617
Ryan asked them not to fire him.

30
00:00:43,667 --> 00:00:44,619
A week later,

31
00:00:44,619 --> 00:00:45,571
an internal memo

32
00:00:45,571 --> 00:00:48,231
from Comcast's COO leaked.

33
00:00:48,231 --> 00:00:49,253
The employee, it said,

34
00:00:49,253 --> 00:00:50,588
"did a lot of what we trained

35
00:00:50,588 --> 00:00:52,473
him and paid him... to do."

36
00:00:52,473 --> 00:00:54,145
It added: keeping a

37
00:00:54,145 --> 00:00:56,568
customer must be done with respect.

38
00:00:56,568 --> 00:00:58,198
One employee was on the line.

39
00:00:58,198 --> 00:00:59,371
Behind him...

40
00:00:59,371 --> 00:01:00,195
the training.

41
00:01:00,195 --> 00:01:01,835
And the pay.
